  "prefLabel": "He-P 803.02 Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2019-07-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 803.02 Scope. This part shall apply to any individual, agency, partnership, corporation, government entity, association or other legal entity operating a nursing home, except:\n\n(a) All facilities listed in RSA 151:2, II(a)-(h); and\n\n(b) All entities which are owned or operated by the state of New Hampshire, pursuant to RSA 151:2, II(i).\n\nSource. #9856-A, eff 1-26-11, EXPIRED: 1-26-19\n\nNew. #12721, INTERIM, eff 1-29-19, EXPIRED: 7-29-19\n\nNew. #12860, eff 8-28-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p800.html"
